# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Values prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ are inlined into
# the app bundle and are readable by anyone who downloads the app — that is fine
# for these two, which are designed to be public and are protected by row-level
# security.
#
# The ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is NOT here and must never be. It lives only as a
# Supabase secret, server-side:
#     supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
